<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Harmonizie — Lentes em Resina | Dra. Daniele Caju</title>
<meta name="description" content="Veja a transformação real de um sorriso com lentes em resina. Avaliação gratuita com a Dra. Daniele Caju em Camboriú/SC.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!--
  =====================================================================
  INSTRUÇÕES PARA O PATRICK
  =====================================================================
  1) CONFIGURAÇÃO — procure "const CONFIG" no <script> final e troque:
     - WHATSAPP_NUMBER pelo número real da Harmonizie (com DDI+DDD, só números)
     - WEBHOOK_URL pela URL do Apps Script publicado (mesmo padrão de sempre)
     O .gs pronto pra colar está no arquivo harmonizie-lentes-webhook.gs

  2) FOTOS ANTES/DEPOIS — galeria com 3 casos reais em carrossel estilo
     cubo 3D, trocando sozinho a cada 4s (para ao arrastar/usar setas).
     Pra adicionar/trocar um caso, procure "var CASES" dentro do <script>
     final e edite/adicione um objeto {before, after}.

  3) O slider funciona por clip-path (sem redimensionar imagem), então
     não precisa recalcular nada ao trocar as fotos. Nos primeiros
     500ms de cada face a barra se move sozinha pra ensinar o gesto,
     e para assim que o usuário toca ou arrasta.
  =====================================================================
-->

<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0A1310;
  --bg-alt:#0E1A15;
  --ink:#F5F1EA;
  --ink-muted:rgba(245,241,234,.62);
  --ink-faint:rgba(245,241,234,.4);
  --gold:#CBA45C;
  --gold-soft:#E4C989;
  --teal:#6FBFA3;
  --line:rgba(203,164,92,.22);
  --glass:rgba(245,241,234,.04);
  --glass-strong:rgba(245,241,234,.07);
  --radius-lg:22px;
  --radius-md:16px;
  --radius-sm:10px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
.eyebrow{
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--gold-soft);
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:10px;
}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";width:22px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);display:inline-block;}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1.08;margin:0;}
h1 em, h2 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold-soft);}
p{margin:0;}
.btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;
  padding:15px 28px;border-radius:100px;border:1px solid transparent;
  cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;
  transition:transform .18s ease, background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.97);}
.btn-primary{background:var(--gold);color:#231708;box-shadow:0 8px 22px -8px rgba(203,164,92,.55);}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--gold-soft);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 30px -8px rgba(203,164,92,.7);}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:rgba(245,241,234,.28);}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-soft);transform:translateY(-2px);}
.btn-block{width:100%;}

/* ---------- reveal on scroll ---------- */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
.reveal-stagger.in > *{animation:fadeUp .6s ease both;}
.reveal-stagger.in > *:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.05s;}
.reveal-stagger.in > *:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s;}
.reveal-stagger.in > *:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.25s;}
.reveal-stagger.in > *:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.35s;}
.reveal-stagger.in > *:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.45s;}
.reveal-stagger.in > *:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.55s;}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
@keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-7px);}}
@keyframes glowPulse{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(203,164,92,.45),0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
  50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(203,164,92,0),0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
}
@keyframes handleGlow{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.4),0 0 0 0 rgba(203,164,92,.55);}
  50%{box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.4),0 0 0 8px rgba(203,164,92,0);}
}
@keyframes sweepX{from{transform:translateX(-130%) skewX(-12deg);}to{transform:translateX(230%) skewX(-12deg);}}
.sweep{position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.sweep::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:36%;height:100%;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.22),transparent);
  transform:translateX(-130%) skewX(-12deg);pointer-events:none;
}
.sweep:hover::after,.sweep:focus-visible::after{animation:sweepX 1.1s ease;}
.sweep-loop::after{animation:sweepX 3.4s ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:1.2s;}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;}
  .reveal-stagger.in > *{animation:none;opacity:1;}
  html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
  .sweep::after,.sweep-loop::after{animation:none;display:none;}
  .compare-handle{animation:none;}
  .float-wa{animation:none;}
}

/* ---------- nav ---------- */
.nav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
  background:rgba(10,19,16,.72);
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.06);
  animation:fadeIn .6s ease both;
}
.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 24px;}
.wordmark{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:21px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.01em;}
.wordmark span{display:block;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:1px;}
.nav .btn{padding:11px 20px;font-size:13.5px;}

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{padding:64px 0 40px;position:relative;}
.hero::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:-120px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  width:900px;height:500px;
  background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(203,164,92,.10), transparent 70%);
  pointer-events:none;
  animation:heroGlowDrift 9s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes heroGlowDrift{
  0%,100%{transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1);opacity:1;}
  50%{transform:translateX(-46%) scale(1.08);opacity:.85;}
}
.hero-inner{text-align:center;position:relative;}
.hero .eyebrow{opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .7s ease .1s forwards;}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(34px,5.6vw,58px);margin:20px auto 0;max-width:760px;
}
.hero h1 .line{display:block;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease both;}
.hero h1 .line:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.25s;}
.hero h1 .line:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.42s;}
.hero-sub{
  font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-muted);
  max-width:520px;margin:20px auto 0;
  opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s ease .58s forwards;
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .hero::before{animation:none;}
  .hero .eyebrow,.hero h1 .line,.hero-sub{animation:none;opacity:1;}
}

/* ---------- compare carousel (crossfade) ---------- */
.compare-stage{margin:44px auto 0;max-width:420px;position:relative;}
.compare-viewport{
  position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;width:100%;
}
.compare{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  box-shadow:0 40px 70px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.7);
  background:#050907;
  touch-action:pan-y;cursor:ew-resize;
  transition:opacity .4s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.compare:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 40px 70px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.7),0 0 0 3px rgba(203,164,92,.5);outline:none;}
.compare.fade-out{opacity:0;}
.compare-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.compare-before{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(0 calc(100% - var(--pos,50%)) 0 0);}
.compare-before .compare-img{width:100%;height:100%;}
.compare-divider{
  position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:var(--pos,50%);
  transform:translateX(-50%);width:0;pointer-events:none;
}
.compare-divider-line{
  position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:2px;transform:translateX(-50%);
  background:rgba(245,241,234,.85);
  box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(245,241,234,.5);
}
.compare-handle{
  position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--gold);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  pointer-events:none;
  animation:handleGlow 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.compare-handle svg{width:20px;height:20px;}
.compare-hint{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted);
}
.compare-hint svg{width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--gold-soft);}
.compare-note{
  margin-top:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);text-align:center;
}

.gallery-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin-top:18px;}
.gallery-arrow{
  width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;
  border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.18);background:rgba(245,241,234,.03);
  color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease, transform .15s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
}
.gallery-arrow:hover{border-color:var(--gold);background:rgba(203,164,92,.1);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 18px -6px rgba(203,164,92,.5);}
.gallery-arrow:active{transform:scale(.94);}
.gallery-arrow svg{width:16px;height:16px;}
.gallery-dots{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.gallery-dot{
  width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,241,234,.22);
  border:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s ease,transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;
}
.gallery-dot.active{background:var(--gold);transform:scale(1.3);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(203,164,92,.7);}

/* ---------- trust strip ---------- */
.trust{padding:44px 0 8px;}
.trust-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;
  background:rgba(245,241,234,.07);border-radius:var(--radius-md);overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.07);
}
.trust-item{
  background:var(--bg);padding:22px 18px;text-align:center;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  transition:background .25s ease,transform .25s ease;
}
.trust-item:hover{background:var(--bg-alt);transform:translateY(-3px);}
.trust-item svg{width:22px;height:22px;color:var(--teal);transition:filter .25s ease;}
.trust-item:hover svg{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(111,191,163,.7));}
.trust-item p{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.4;}

/* ---------- credibility ---------- */
.cred{padding:80px 0;}
.cred-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.82fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;}
.cred h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px);}
.cred p.body{margin-top:16px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;}
.cred-card{
  background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  padding:26px;backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(245,241,234,.06), 0 20px 40px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
  transition:border-color .3s ease,box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.cred-card:hover{border-color:rgba(203,164,92,.4);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(245,241,234,.08),0 20px 44px -20px rgba(203,164,92,.25);}
.cred-card ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}
.cred-card li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);}
.cred-card li svg{width:18px;height:18px;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;}
.cred-card strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}

.pro-media{position:relative;padding:0 22px 32px 0;}
.pro-photo-main{
  border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/5;
  border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 34px 60px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.65);
  position:relative;
  animation:floaty 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.pro-photo-main img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
.pro-photo-accent{
  position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;width:46%;aspect-ratio:4/5;
  border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:4px solid var(--bg);
  box-shadow:0 18px 34px -14px rgba(0,0,0,.65);
  animation:floaty 6s ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:.4s;
}
.pro-photo-accent img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
.pro-badge{
  position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:14px;
  background:rgba(10,19,16,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.16);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;
}
.pro-badge-name{display:block;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;}
.pro-badge-role{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gold-soft);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:3px;}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .pro-photo-main,.pro-photo-accent{animation:none;}
}

@media (max-width:520px){
  .pro-media{padding:0 14px 24px 0;}
  .pro-photo-accent{width:44%;}
}

/* ---------- faq ---------- */
.faq{padding:16px 0 64px;}
.faq-head{text-align:center;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 32px;}
.faq-head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px);margin-top:16px;}
.faq-list{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
.faq-item{
  border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.1);border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  background:var(--glass);overflow:hidden;
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  transition:border-color .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease,transform .2s ease;
}
.faq-item:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:rgba(245,241,234,.2);}
.faq-item.open{border-color:rgba(203,164,92,.45);box-shadow:0 16px 32px -20px rgba(203,164,92,.4);}
.faq-q{
  width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
  padding:18px 20px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
}
.faq-q-icon{
  flex-shrink:0;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;
  border:1px solid rgba(203,164,92,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  color:var(--gold-soft);transition:transform .25s ease,background .2s ease;
}
.faq-q-icon svg{width:11px;height:11px;}
.faq-item.open .faq-q-icon{transform:rotate(45deg);background:rgba(203,164,92,.14);}
.faq-a{
  max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease;
}
.faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:220px;}
.faq-a-inner{padding:0 20px 18px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-muted);}
.faq-a-inner strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}

/* ---------- sondagem / form ---------- */
.form-section{padding:24px 0 90px;}
.form-head{text-align:center;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 32px;}
.form-head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px);margin-top:16px;}
.form-head p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:15.5px;}

.wizard{
  max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;
  background:var(--glass-strong);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
  padding:32px 26px;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(245,241,234,.07), 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
  transition:box-shadow .35s ease;
}
.wizard:focus-within{box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(245,241,234,.09),0 30px 60px -24px rgba(203,164,92,.28);}
.wizard-progress{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:26px;}
.wizard-dot{height:3px;flex:1;background:rgba(245,241,234,.14);border-radius:100px;overflow:hidden;}
.wizard-dot i{display:block;height:100%;width:0%;background:var(--gold);transition:width .4s ease;}
.wizard-dot.done i{width:100%;}
.wizard-dot.active i{width:100%;}

.step{display:none;}
.step.active{display:block;animation:stepIn .35s ease;}
@keyframes stepIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0);}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.step.active{animation:none;}}

.step-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-soft);}
.step h3{font-size:20px;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.3;}

.chip-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;}
.chip{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:15px 18px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.14);background:rgba(245,241,234,.02);
  color:var(--ink);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;
  cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
}
.chip:hover{border-color:rgba(203,164,92,.4);transform:translateX(3px);}
.chip.selected{border-color:var(--gold);background:rgba(203,164,92,.1);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(203,164,92,.25),0 8px 20px -12px rgba(203,164,92,.6);}
.chip .dot{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid rgba(245,241,234,.3);flex-shrink:0;position:relative;transition:border-color .2s ease;}
.chip.selected .dot{border-color:var(--gold);}
.chip.selected .dot::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);}

.field{margin-top:18px;}
.field label{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:7px;}
.field input{
  width:100%;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
  border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.16);background:rgba(245,241,234,.03);
  color:var(--ink);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:16px;
  outline:none;transition:border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
}
.field input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-faint);}
.field input:focus{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(203,164,92,.18);}
.field-error{font-size:12px;color:#E28080;margin-top:6px;display:none;}
.field-error.show{display:block;}

.step-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:26px;}
.step-actions .btn-ghost{flex:0 0 auto;padding:14px 18px;}
.step-actions .btn-primary{flex:1;}

.confirm-summary{
  margin-top:20px;background:rgba(245,241,234,.03);border:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.1);
  border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:16px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;
}
.confirm-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13.5px;gap:12px;}
.confirm-row span:first-child{color:var(--ink-faint);}
.confirm-row span:last-child{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;text-align:right;}

.success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:10px 0 4px;}
.success.active{display:block;animation:stepIn .35s ease;}
.success-icon{
  width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(111,191,163,.14);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px;
}
.success-icon svg{width:26px;height:26px;color:var(--teal);}
.success h3{font-size:21px;}
.success p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;}
.success .btn{margin-top:22px;}

/* ---------- footer ---------- */
footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(245,241,234,.07);padding:34px 0 110px;}
.footer-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;text-align:center;}
